{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33593","headline":"讲德陈情上淮南李仆射八首 二 · 许棠","name":"讲德陈情上淮南李仆射八首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多朝轩冕冠乾坤，四海皆推圣最尊。\n楚玉已曾分卞玉，膺门依旧是龙门。\n筵开乐振高云动，城掩鼙收落日昏。\n尝念苍生如赤子，九州无处不沾恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}